          <SubComponents>
            <Component class="javax.swing.JTextArea" name="txtAInstructions">
              <Properties>
                <Property name="background" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
                  <Color blue="0" green="0" red="0" type="rgb"/>
                </Property>
                <Property name="columns" type="int" value="20"/>
                <Property name="font" type="java.awt.Font" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.FontEditor">
                  <Font name="Pixelify Sans" size="24" style="1"/>
                </Property>
                <Property name="foreground" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
                  <Color blue="33" green="33" red="ff" type="rgb"/>
                </Property>
                <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
                <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="1. Movement:&#xa;   - Use the WASD or the ARROW keys to navigate your player through the level. &#xa;   Press the W, UP ARROW, or Space key to make your player jump. You have the &#xa;   ability to jump twice consecutively before landing.&#xa;&#xa;2. Objective:&#xa;   - Collect all the coins scattered throughout the level and reach the end of &#xa;   the level. Once all coins are collected, a door will open. Successfully reach the door&#xa;   to display the winning screen, which will display your calculated score.&#xa; &#xa;3. Obstacles:&#xa;   - Avoid spikes and moving obstacles, as they will instantly kill your player. Killing the&#xa;   player will cause the player position to reset back to the start, and it will also&#xa;   reset the collected coins back to 0.&#xa;&#xa;4. Lives:&#xa;   - You start with 3 lives. Losing a life occurs when your player is hit by a spike or &#xa;  moving obstacle.&#xa;&#xa;5. Game Over:&#xa;   - If you run out of lives, the game ends and the game over screen will be displayed. &#xa;   Try to complete each level with the highest number of lives possible. You will be &#xa;   given a score upon completion of the level. Score is calculated&#xa;   based on time and lives.&#xa;&#xa;6. Other:&#xa; - Press the (ESC) key to pause the game.  Press the (H) key to show hitboxes."/>
                <Property name="border" type="javax.swing.border.Border" editor="org.netbeans.modules.form.editors2.BorderEditor">
                  <Border info="null"/>
                </Property>
                <Property name="cursor" type="java.awt.Cursor" editor="org.netbeans.modules.form.editors2.CursorEditor">
                  <Color id="Text Cursor"/>
                </Property>
                <Property name="disabledTextColor" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
                  <Color blue="0" green="0" red="0" type="rgb"/>
                </Property>
                <Property name="focusable" type="boolean" value="false"/>
              </Properties>
            </Component>
